    mode: An optional `string` from: `"MIN_COMBINED", "MIN_FIRST", "SCALED"`. Defaults to `"MIN_COMBINED"`.
    narrow_range: An optional `bool`. Defaults to `False`.
    axis: An optional `int`. Defaults to `-1`.
